<Slide style={{ padding: '0px' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 10, background: '#0E3F8C' }} />
  <Box style={{ padding: '30px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>第三个发现：什么时候模型会「帮倒忙」</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ padding: '18px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Image src="assets/weather_scenarios.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: 250, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, height: 180, marginTop: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 18px', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>辐射几乎不动时</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>−163%</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>随机森林反而比 Persistence 差，错得非常夸张。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 18px', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>辐射突变 30~60</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>+14.54%</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>模型开始有用，但收益不大。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 18px', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>辐射剧变 &gt;60</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>+17.90%</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>云来了，模型才真正站上风。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, width: '100%', height: 84, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 24px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        所以工程上不该一味上模型：晴天平稳时段直接用上一刻功率就够了，把算力留给云来了的那一刻。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 40, bottom: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>10 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
